  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a bowl, mix together chopped apricots, sliced almonds, honey, olive oil, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Thread the mixture onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Grill the skewers for 5 minutes per side, or until the apricots are tender.",
    "Grill the diced chicken breast for 5-6 minutes per side, or until it reaches an internal temperature of 165 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Serve the grilled chicken breast with the apricot and almond skewers.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
